<div class="ol_wrap"><p class="ListNumber1"><a name="_a7b1e2fe-d09b-324a-9d2a-3c498c818bb9" id="_a7b1e2fe-d09b-324a-9d2a-3c498c818bb9"></a>a)<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0;</span>Available expertise in each language</p>

