<p class="ListNumber1"><a name="_88224222-701e-962a-aca5-4cd7f2314fe8" id="_88224222-701e-962a-aca5-4cd7f2314fe8"></a>c)<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0;</span>Technology infrastructure</p>

