<p class="ListNumber1"><a name="_6edd7b53-e3a1-4280-f1da-d6c469570191" id="_6edd7b53-e3a1-4280-f1da-d6c469570191"></a>e)<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0;</span>Quality requirements</p>

<p class="ListNumber1"><a name="_9f59b625-4a70-7158-65a0-802d1d0b90aa" id="_9f59b625-4a70-7158-65a0-802d1d0b90aa"></a>f)<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0;</span>Timeline considerations</p>

</div>
</div>

