<div><a name="_6eb76fd6-a65e-8b04-1e95-1e2bcaf5155b" id="_6eb76fd6-a65e-8b04-1e95-1e2bcaf5155b"></a><h3>8.4.1<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Concept identification and analysis</h3>

