<div class="ol_wrap"><p class="ListNumber1"><a name="_4dfa3e8b-22ad-128b-1a7c-157cb78ec5b8" id="_4dfa3e8b-22ad-128b-1a7c-157cb78ec5b8"></a>a)<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0;</span>Extract term candidates from authoritative sources</p>

<p class="ListNumber1"><a name="_f2b071c7-7c3a-8eb6-70b9-7b84ab8f5bfa" id="_f2b071c7-7c3a-8eb6-70b9-7b84ab8f5bfa"></a>b)<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0;</span>Research existing terminology usage in each language</p>

