<div class="ol_wrap"><p class="ListNumber1"><a name="_fda90de7-9114-dae1-f549-6c1ece3ada71" id="_fda90de7-9114-dae1-f549-6c1ece3ada71"></a>a)<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0;</span>Draft definitions in authoritative language(s)</p>

