<p class="ListNumber1"><a name="_edd530e6-74ef-77ac-a06c-c2d254f98472" id="_edd530e6-74ef-77ac-a06c-c2d254f98472"></a>d)<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0;</span>Identification of recurring issues</p>

