</div>
</div>
        <div><a name="_de1bb8f3-32db-9d0c-69e9-75fe0ef00550" id="_de1bb8f3-32db-9d0c-69e9-75fe0ef00550"></a><h2>9.4<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Multilingual database design</h2>

