<div class="ol_wrap"><p class="ListNumber1"><a name="_37bd6606-5558-fcc8-7290-b3830a7eac47" id="_37bd6606-5558-fcc8-7290-b3830a7eac47"></a>a)<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0;</span>Real-time terminology verification</p>

