</div>

<div><a name="_311cb2a0-2f7c-fc17-b426-b6a76f7a42ad" id="_311cb2a0-2f7c-fc17-b426-b6a76f7a42ad"></a><h3>9.5.2<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Translation management integration</h3>

